cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "VisionLeader: Neuro-Symbolic Indoor Navigation for Visually Impaired Users"
abstract: >-
  An assistive indoor navigation system that combines on-device speech
  recognition, a vision-language model that grounds campus signage into PDDL
  atoms, and a classical planner (Fast Downward, A* with LM-Cut) that computes
  provably optimal routes, coordinated by a finite-state dialogue agent.
